    "rawMarkdown": "Looking at a single race (Austria 2022)\n`aus_2022 = df.query(\"year == 2022\").query(\"race == 'Austrian Grand Prix'\").sort_values(by='lapnumber')`\n\nand plotting the stints over lapnumber by driver\n`sns.lineplot(data=aus_2022, x='lapnumber', y='stint', hue='driver')`\n\nI expect this to be stairsteps and to never go back down.\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F3927421%2F64c160716e705904b7ab314607682435%2FScreenshot%202026-05-01%20at%2011.54.26AM.png?generation=1777654484943907&alt=media)\n\nLooking at a single driver shows\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F3927421%2F66bef3564e526fca843b05694557061d%2FScreenshot%202026-05-01%20at%2011.56.31AM.png?generation=1777654635432578&alt=media)",
    "content": "<p>Looking at a single race (Austria 2022)\n<code>aus_2022 = df.query(\"year == 2022\").query(\"race == 'Austrian Grand Prix'\").sort_values(by='lapnumber')</code></p>\n<p>and plotting the stints over lapnumber by driver\n<code>sns.lineplot(data=aus_2022, x='lapnumber', y='stint', hue='driver')</code></p>\n<p>I expect this to be stairsteps and to never go back down.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F3927421%2F64c160716e705904b7ab314607682435%2FScreenshot%202026-05-01%20at%2011.54.26AM.png?generation=1777654484943907&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Looking at a single driver shows</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F3927421%2F66bef3564e526fca843b05694557061d%2FScreenshot%202026-05-01%20at%2011.56.31AM.png?generation=1777654635432578&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>",
